OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 10, doubles fundraising goal
OL,4,Aafter sea swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old girl who has swum in the
OL,7,Fsea every day for a year has smashed
OL,8,Fher charity fundraising goal.
OL,10,FClara, from Southwold in Suffolk, has
OL,11,Fraised more than #12,000 for the RNLI -
OL,12,Fdoubling her original target, having
OL,13,Fheard about similar year-long
OL,14,Fchallenges.
OL,16,F"Last year, I came and sat on the prom,
OL,17,Fvery silent, and I walked up to my
OL,18,Fparents and said 'I've decided to swim
OL,19,Fin the sea every day for a year'.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
